Subject: Allow the supported builder SDK

Upstream pins SDK 6 with feature-band roll-forward. Permit major-version
roll-forward so the supported .NET 10 builder can build the same targets.

diff --git a/Src/global.json b/Src/global.json
--- a/Src/global.json
+++ b/Src/global.json
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 {
   "sdk": {
     "version": "6.0.400",
-    "rollForward": "latestFeature"
+    "rollForward": "latestMajor"
   }
 }
